From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:02:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: Add the Apcsilmic Dot 1

Add the Apcsilmic Dot 1, a Snapdragon 7c mini PC with two HDMI ports
and optional LTE. It builds on sc7180-cls07180-ufs.dtsi with nothing
added. Its DSDT is the TCL Book 14 Go's without the keyboard, touchpad,
display bridge and SAR sensor. The USB-C port, the camera on the USB
hub and the PEP entries for an eDP bridge and fingerprint reader that
it keeps are leftovers of the shared laptop firmware.

Neither HDMI path is in the DSDT, so the display stays on the
firmware's framebuffer, on whichever port the firmware lights. The
modem image is the WLAN-only qcmpss7180_nm.mbn, as on the TCL, and the
firmware has to come from an owner's Windows install.

Its owner reports that GRUB starts but generic ACPI kernels stop after
ExitBootServices with no output, and that OpenBSD boots until USB drops
out. No SMBIOS strings are known for it, so it has no hardware IDs yet.
Not booted on the machine yet.

Link: https://github.com/aarch64-laptops/build/issues/117
Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sc7180-apcsilmic-dot-1.dts  | 30 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 30 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc7180-apcsilmic-dot-1.dts

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc7180-apcsilmic-dot-1.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc7180-apcsilmic-dot-1.dts
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..fceea41
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc7180-apcsilmic-dot-1.dts
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
+/*
+ * Apcsilmic Dot 1
+ *
+ * A 7c mini PC with two HDMI ports. Its DSDT describes neither HDMI
+ * path, so the display stays on the firmware's framebuffer and the
+ * display subsystem and GPU stay off.
+ */
+
+/dts-v1/;
+
+#include "sc7180-cls07180-ufs.dtsi"
+
+/ {
+	model = "Apcsilmic Dot 1";
+	compatible = "apcsilmic,dot-1", "qcom,sc7180";
+	chassis-type = "desktop";
+};
+
+&remoteproc_adsp {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/sc7180/apcsilmic/dot-1/qcadsp7180.mbn";
+};
+
+&remoteproc_mpss {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/sc7180/apcsilmic/dot-1/qcmpss7180_nm.mbn";
+};
+
+&venus {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/sc7180/apcsilmic/dot-1/qcvss7180.mbn";
+};
